Package: FEDAI
Type: Package
Title: Tables and Datasets Used in 'Field Experiments: Design, Analysis, and Interpretation'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Alexander", "Coppock", email = "acoppock@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5733-2386"))
Description: Provides the tables, study datasets, and helper functions used in
    Field Experiments: Design, Analysis, and Interpretation by Alan S. Gerber
    and Donald P. Green (2012, ISBN:9780393979954). The datasets are the ones
    distributed by the ISPS Data Archive as study D081
    <doi:10.60600/YU/VUH8KD>; 'data-raw/' records how each was built from that
    archive.
URL: https://alexandercoppock.com/FEDAI/, https://github.com/acoppock/FEDAI
BugReports: https://github.com/acoppock/FEDAI/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    tibble
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    DeclareDesign,
    randomizr
